# Cloudflare Pages Redirects for Oriens Academy
# Root language redirect: clean host-level redirect to Turkish default locale
/    /tr/    302
/tr/sinavlar/ukcat/    /tr/sinavlar/ucat/    301
/en/exams/ukcat/       /en/exams/ucat/       301

# Blog detail pages: static export can't pre-render unbounded slugs, so any
# /{locale}/blog/{slug}/ request that has no matching static file (Cloudflare
# Pages only consults this file after that check fails) is rewritten -- not
# redirected -- to the fixed blog/post shell, which reads the real slug from
# window.location client-side. Status 200 keeps the pretty URL in the browser.
/tr/blog/:slug/    /tr/blog/post/    200
/en/blog/:slug/    /en/blog/post/    200
